data: {"id": "93d67e506f624d02-thinking-parallel_evidence-1676", "run_id": "93d67e506f624d02", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 事实汇总与冲突\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **Pod 状态** | `phase=Pending`，`ContainerCreating`（`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ContainerCreating`），重启=0，UID=`f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`，节点=`node2` |\n| **Volume 配置** | Pod spec 定义了一个 `hostPath` 卷 `input`，路径为 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` |\n| **Events** | `FailedMount`（x23 over 30m）: **`hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory`**；另一次 `FailedMount", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789128561681, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

