明确指出 `hostPath type check failed` 及具体路径 (证据 #2)。\n- **状态佐证**：Pod 处于 `Pending` 且容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (证据 #1, #3)。\n- **排他性证据**：容器重启次数为 0 (证据 #6)，证明问题不出在应用运行时，而出在初始化挂载阶段。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 40.0s (Evidence 35.1s, RCA 4.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.194, "metrics": {"run_id": "93d67e506f624d02", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.20036745071411, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalti